# Code quality

- Format and lint with Biome. Do not mix ESLint and Prettier on the same tree unless that mix is documented.
- Run Fallow (`fallow dead-code`) for unused exports and dependencies as part of `check`.
- No unexplained `any` or `@ts-ignore`.
- Keep `build`, `lint`, `typecheck`, `test`, and `test:e2e` green in CI.

Details: `docs/frontend/tools/CODE_QUALITY.md`
